<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked ADF gunmen continue mass killings in Ituri province, targeting civilians and health workers amid the Ebola outbreak, while the DRC army captured an alleged ADF intelligence officer. The Uganda People’s Defence Force rotated fresh troops under Operation Shujaa to counter the ADF threat in the region. M23 rebels violated a ceasefire by seizing a major town in eastern DRC. The conflict still accounts for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNVUtwQ00wRnhmV1NzcW42ZUZteE50OG1rMFo3YV9kclpIY18xdk9OOVFiSjJRVVU2Q1Zmb1hxOC1xekplMmE1ckxXNHhFbHJEeGRQT1piWURlYU5pdUo1akM2SHR6UzFwUGxQVnRyRWJSZGJ5UUJRdURnSDdrM2VOMGNVc0Q0NG82b1Vr?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPUlNKa1czLUlvUUJzZkNRNlUwamRMX3FJWGc5X0lSNjQ5Wjl3TjhVNkpaVHYtdy1BdU9EV3F1ajJ4cXg3clVDdzRyTFNVUVhmUTZoNWcxQU5wTUx6UExfcHpyTGFuX1Y3b3Z3WTVNN0w1aDJWMXBDM3kzcmw5a3h5VVh3eDc2RU5sbm1qN1ZIbGdacVNTazVrU0FzWkxpaUw3eXVsZEtQc0ZPcG5EaXRwX2NGSkc0aVN1UndYRHp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBqQ01qb3lwNWhSR0VzZy1pZ2Rxa0VKNllXa0FOaGVJeWg5bnROUm9VaGZhODYwbnQ0Rl9VbXd3THBCMU5LR2tyQkVUWVl1cmFDZV8xckVvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQUmcxM1hmM2taUVRnX2N2UGtpanJjQ1FTMGlqYzNHcllWNUdUSHBfN0QzeXBMeFUtRk50bWpwY2dnSmxnZHI2a0dGaU80U0s0bEd5S2lyejNmRXRjOXIwVEcyblBwSGIydVZOcl9PcWFuRElGYm5JbjlIN212ZTRlV1MyT0MycDVQRHVsM3IxdWFsNWZaRGpR?oc=5&quot;&gt;SOFREP&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE5hYk10b09rcjF3SFhndFl0eC1MYkdRR1otNDlqNjYwZHUwV2pNbE9lSDV2T0NyeExQUDRPWkJCTUxyZjhoT09vSGVQbF9